Z||000002||Standard||07-10-2000||05:42 AM||||I would check to make sure that all the heat shields are bolted down tight.  <BR>Any noises from the exhaust (other than a nice rumble or a not so nice ticking) will usually be squeeks.<P>------------------<BR>Mike -- Golden Valley, MN<BR>Black 86.5 GT 5 Spd, 147,000 miles and counting!||||reg||1
Z||000003||Monkeyman||07-10-2000||11:43 AM||||If it's only happening close to your house, you might have left your cordless phone in the trunk.  If it happens all the time, I would suggest you look in your trunk to see if you left you cell phone in there.<P>------------------<BR>Dave-<BR>Grape Ape ('85GT)||||reg||1
